Klimes George wrote:

>   I am having some problems with my ethernet card DE500.
>   I am running RedHat Linux 4.2 on DEC's alpha 433a
>   wiht 21164 processor.

 You probably don't have a kernel with the appropriate device driver.
Re-compile the kernel answering
'y' to the question:

    DE425, DE434, DE435 support (CONFIG_DE4X5)?

This includes the DE500 driver. You can then copy the new kernel to root
